---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Fees & resources" description="Contact SWEEP Schools for the current approved fee schedules, uniform information, application forms and other school documents.">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">Fees & school resources</span><h1>Clear information for<br />confident planning.</h1><p>Find the documents you need and contact the school for the latest approved fees and requirements.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container content-grid"><div class="prose"><h2>Current fees</h2><p>School fees and related costs can change. To avoid publishing an outdated price list, this preview does not display fee amounts. Please request the current approved fee schedule directly from SWEEP Schools.</p><div class="fee-notice"><strong>Important:</strong> The public website has previously linked to school and uniform price lists. Those documents must be checked for their current year, applicability and approval before being republished.</div><div class="resource-list"><div class="resource-row"><div><strong>School fee schedule</strong><small>Request the latest approved schedule for the relevant school phase.</small></div><a href="mailto:schools@sweeplife.co.za?subject=Request%20for%20current%20SWEEP%20Schools%20fee%20schedule" aria-label="Request current fee schedule"><span>Request ↗</span></a></div><div class="resource-row"><div><strong>Uniform price list</strong><small>Ask the school for the current uniform list and prices.</small></div><a href="mailto:schools@sweeplife.co.za?subject=Request%20for%20current%20SWEEP%20uniform%20price%20list" aria-label="Request current uniform price list"><span>Request ↗</span></a></div><div class="resource-row"><div><strong>Admissions forms and documents</strong><small>Confirm which forms apply to your child’s age group or grade.</small></div><a href="/admissions/" aria-label="Admissions information"><span>View ↗</span></a></div></div></div><aside class="info-card"><h3>Need a document?</h3><p>Contact the school to confirm which document is current and whether it applies to SWEEP Kidz or SWEEP Academy.</p><p><a href="mailto:schools@sweeplife.co.za">schools@sweeplife.co.za</a></p><a class="button" href="mailto:schools@sweeplife.co.za?subject=SWEEP%20Schools%20documents%20request">Request a document <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></aside></div></section>
</BaseLayout>